  (text "HSI48 + CRS for USB; no external HSE fitted. Validate clock accuracy over PVT.\nVDDA filter and VCAP are NOT optional; VCAP must not supply external loads.\nSecurity requires signed boot/update, monotonic rollback state and debug lifecycle.\nThese schematic nets do not configure or prove those protections."
